<Layout title="Affiliate Disclosure" description="How Bright Picks uses affiliate links and earns commission.">
  <section class="pad">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> · Disclosure</p>
      <h1>Affiliate disclosure</h1>
      <p>Bright Picks is a participant in the Amazon EU Associates Programme, an affiliate advertising programme designed to provide a means for sites to earn advertising fees by advertising and linking to Amazon.co.uk.</p>
      <p><strong>As an Amazon Associate we earn from qualifying purchases.</strong> When you click a "Check price on Amazon" link on this site and go on to buy, we may receive a small commission. It comes out of Amazon's margin — it never adds anything to the price you pay.</p>
      <p>Our recommendations are based on product features, real-world usefulness and value for money. Commission never decides our rankings. Prices and availability on Amazon change frequently, so we link you to the live listing rather than quote a figure that goes stale — always confirm the current price and delivery details on Amazon before you buy.</p>
      <p>Questions about how our links work? See our <a href="/privacy/">privacy page</a> or <a href="/contact/">get in touch</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
